      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Local TypeScript MCP server (my-memory-mcp/dist/server.js)\nMcpServer + StdioServerTransport, registerMemoryTools() exposes 6 of the SDK's 12 tools:\nmemory_create_conversation \u00b7 memory_add_messages \u00b7 memory_get_context\nmemory_search_messages \u00b7 memory_get_entity \u00b7 memory_add_entity",
      "originalText": "Local TypeScript MCP server (my-memory-mcp/dist/server.js)\nMcpServer + StdioServerTransport, registerMemoryTools() exposes 6 of the SDK's 12 tools:\nmemory_create_conversation \u00b7 memory_add_messages \u00b7 memory_get_context\nmemory_search_messages \u00b7 memory_get_entity \u00b7 memory_add_entity",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
