      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Reasoning-memory tools are excluded from this server: NAMS has no verified complete cleanup route for those records.\nThe workspace-scoped MEMORY_API_KEY cannot rotate or revoke itself; only an authenticated owner or admin client can.",
